# Supplementary Code S1 (R component) – Analysis Pipeline
# "Species composition, structural traits, and allometric bias as indicators
#  of fire-driven biomass vulnerability in Afroalpine Erica ecosystems"
# Forest Ecology and Management (Revised Manuscript)
